@startuml
title Mock simplificado do meio de pagamento

autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Teste automatizado" as TEST
control "Pagamento Service" as PS
boundary "Mock Payment API" as MOCK
database "Mock DB" as DB
queue "Kafka" as KAFKA
control "Assinatura Service" as AS

== Criar pagamento ==

PS -> MOCK: POST /v1/payments\nIdempotency-Key: assinatura_uuid

note over PS, MOCK
  Requisição:
  {
    "externalReference": "assinatura_uuid",
    "amount": 4990,
    "currency": "BRL",
    "paymentMethod": "PIX",
    "notificationUrl":
      "https://api.exemplo.com/webhooks/payments"
  }
end note

MOCK -> DB: Buscar pela Idempotency-Key

alt Pagamento já existe
    DB --> MOCK: pagamento existente
    MOCK --> PS: 200 OK\nMesma cobrança
else Novo pagamento
    DB --> MOCK: vazio
    MOCK -> DB: INSERT pagamento\nstatus = PENDING
    MOCK --> PS: 201 Created
end

note over PS, MOCK
  Resposta:
  {
    "id": "pay_uuid",
    "externalReference": "assinatura_uuid",
    "amount": 4990,
    "currency": "BRL",
    "paymentMethod": "PIX",
    "status": "PENDING",
    "pixCode": "000201010212...",
    "expiresAt": "2026-07-29T13:30:00Z"
  }
end note

== Simular aprovação ou recusa ==

TEST -> MOCK: POST /v1/mock/payments/pay_uuid/status

note over TEST, MOCK
  Requisição:
  {
    "status": "APPROVED"
  }

  Também pode receber REJECTED,
  CANCELLED ou EXPIRED.
end note

MOCK -> DB: UPDATE pagamento\nstatus = APPROVED
MOCK --> TEST: 202 Accepted

note over TEST, MOCK
  Resposta:
  {
    "paymentId": "pay_uuid",
    "previousStatus": "PENDING",
    "status": "APPROVED",
    "webhookScheduled": true
  }
end note

== Enviar webhook ==

MOCK -> PS: POST /webhooks/payments\nX-Mock-Event-Id: evt_uuid\nX-Mock-Signature: sha256=hmac

note over MOCK, PS
  Requisição:
  {
    "id": "evt_uuid",
    "type": "payment.updated",
    "data": {
      "paymentId": "pay_uuid",
      "externalReference": "assinatura_uuid"
    }
  }
end note

PS -> PS: Validar assinatura\ne deduplicar eventId
PS --> MOCK: 200 OK

note over MOCK, PS
  Resposta:
  {
    "received": true,
    "eventId": "evt_uuid"
  }
end note

== Consultar status oficial ==

PS -> MOCK: GET /v1/payments/pay_uuid
MOCK -> DB: SELECT pagamento
DB --> MOCK: pagamento APPROVED
MOCK --> PS: 200 OK

note over PS, MOCK
  Resposta:
  {
    "id": "pay_uuid",
    "externalReference": "assinatura_uuid",
    "amount": 4990,
    "currency": "BRL",
    "paymentMethod": "PIX",
    "status": "APPROVED",
    "approvedAt": "2026-07-29T13:05:00Z"
  }
end note

== Publicar resultado ==

PS -> KAFKA: PagamentoStatusAtualizado\n{\n  "assinaturaId": "assinatura_uuid",\n  "status": "APPROVED"\n}
KAFKA -> AS: PagamentoStatusAtualizado
AS -> AS: Ativar assinatura

note over MOCK, DB
  UNIQUE(idempotency_key) evita cobranças duplicadas.
  O endpoint /v1/mock/... existe apenas em testes.
end note

@enduml
